{
  "name": "Dreadful Strikes",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can augment your weapon strikes with mind-scarring magic, drawn from the gloomy hollows of the Feywild. When you hit a creature with a weapon, you can deal an extra 1d4 psychic damage to the target, which can take this extra damage only once per turn.</p><p>The extra damage increases to 2d4 when you reach 11th level in this class.</p>",
